sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as Employee
    participant W as Web app
    participant A as Supabase Auth
    participant API as API
    participant DB as Postgres

    U->>W: Continue with Google
    W->>A: sign in
    A-->>W: signed token (has email)
    W->>API: GET /api/me  +  token
    API->>A: fetch public key (cached)
    API->>API: verify token signature
    API->>DB: is this email on the invite list?
    alt not invited or deactivated
        API-->>W: 403 not_invited
        W-->>U: "Ask your manager to add you"
    else invited
        DB-->>API: person, role, stores
        API-->>W: me + my stores
        U->>W: types the worksheet
        W->>API: PUT /api/reports (autosave)
        API->>API: check store access, recalculate totals
        API->>DB: save worksheet + audit log
        API-->>W: saved report with totals
    end
